Pygame Shooters: A project for the ICS3U class. It is a shooting game created with the Pygame library using knowledge up and until functions (not allowed to use classes)

Installation Instructions: You must have pygame download on your device to play this game. Install the entire folder, run the "Gameplay.py" file.

